        "created_at": "2016-09-17T16:39:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near mint.</p><p>Second game, let Sky-Scraper get ko'd while huge to act as an indestructible meat shield. Threw a Wounding Buffer on her for good measure. Did double-draws with Guise and Cosmic for the first two rounds, knowing I was going to not be able to play anything in the second round anyway and any constructs I put in play would get blasted by the Orbital Bombardment. Finished with Guise standing alone with 2 hp.</p>",
