      {
        "id": 182294,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-09-19T01:32:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint on Mobile, and it was a close one, helped by knowing what was coming. Managed to keep everyone alive, with one big thing being having Cortex Hyperstimulator on Progeny for half the game and, in conjunction with that, leaving Scion of Flame out a little longer than I might normally have. A handy Rebounding Debilitator + Time of Tribulations being played the same turn Progeny flipped ended up being a turn where he did 5 damage to himself and none to me. Guise ended up doing most of the last stretch thanks to Super Kawaii, Guise the Barbarian and and Dynamic Syphon, and Sky-Scraper finished things off with a Colossal Left Hook --&gt; Explosive Reveal and Cosmic Weapon.</p>",
