        "created_at": "2016-09-19T12:31:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint on my phone. The first time I played this I kept Frost around so this time I went with Blight. Blight is definitely easier.  Highlight of the match was playing Compulsion Canister on Guise to get him under 10 HP.</p>",
